            "description_html": "<b>AHI AP-SIG400-630  Contemporary Round Stainless Steel  Appliance Pull</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis very contemporary designed refrigerator/appliance pull is made of solid stainless steel by AHI Hardware, a leader in stainless door hardware. Warm Satin Stainless Steel finish for a truly eye catching design. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Matching <a href=\"/products/modern-stainless-steel-leverset-ahi-sig152\"><b>Contemporary Door Levers</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AP-SIG400_pull-size.gif?v=1704442269\" width=\"400\" height=\"375\" border=\"0\" alt=\"AHI AP-SIG400 Contemporary Appliance Pull\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for AHI AP-SIG400-630 Contemporary Door Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Height: 350 mm (13.78\")</li>\r\n<!-- <li>Mounting Centers: 350 mm (13.78\") C/C</li> -->\r\n<li>Projection: 69 mm (2.72\")</li>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 35 mm (1.38\") Round</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li> \r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with mounting screws for a standard 3/4\" thick refrigerator/appliance door panel.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
